OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright day,
OL,6,Fwith spells of hazy sunshine. A few
OL,7,Flight showers are possible, mainly
OL,8,Fduring the morning and in the south. A
OL,9,Flight northerly breezy, allowing
OL,10,Ftemperatures to be a little lower than
OL,11,Fof late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome sunshine ahead of dusk,
OL,14,Fthen a clear night with light winds. A
OL,15,Flittle cooler for many, but likely to
OL,16,Fstay warm for urban areas. Perhaps
OL,17,Fcloud increasing towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
