OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA rather cloudy start in
OL,6,Fplaces, with perhaps an isolated light
OL,7,Fshower. Soon brightening up with
OL,8,Flengthy spells of sunshine developing.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant for most.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fcloudy Monday, with rain possible
OL,13,Fovernight. This clearing to sunny
OL,14,Fspells Tuesday and Wednesday, with the
OL,15,Fchance of a few showers. Temperatures
OL,16,Fnearer average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
